</div>
</section>
<section id="Sx2" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">GenAI Usage Disclosure</h2>

<div id="Sx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We used OpenAI’s ChatGPT to improve the clarity and grammar of sentences during the writing process. Neither generative AI tools were used for the development of ideas or data analysis.</p>
</div>
</section>
